{"error": false, "page": 2, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 2, "recordCount": 110, "data": [{"docid2": 1565807, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202009/t20200901_1565807.htm", "content": "\n　　今年是污染防治攻坚战的决胜之年、收官之年、大考之年，市生态环境局坚持目标导向、问题导向，乘势而上、乘胜追击，以决战决胜的信心和决心啃“硬骨头”、扛“硬任务”，做实“绿色三明”文章，绘就“水美三明”", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202009/t20200901_1565807.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.01 09:51:00", "doctitle": "推行“交叉互查” 绘就“水美三明”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1649975, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202009/t20200901_1565807.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1557924, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202008/t20200810_1557924.htm", "content": "\n　　为准确、及时、全面地反映环境质量现状及发展趋势，三明市沙县生态环境局于近日委托第三方专业机构利用专业VOCs、环境空气6参数走航车对重点区域周边以及辖区重点路段、企业污染排放进行动态监测，进一步掌握沙", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202008/t20200810_1557924.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.10 15:25:00", "doctitle": "沙县实行环境空气质量走航监测", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1641256, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202008/t20200810_1557924.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202008/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1552796, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/t20200722_1552796.htm", "content": "\n　　三明市认真抓好生态环境领域专项整治，辖区生态环境质量持续向好。上半年，市区空气质量达标天数比例为100%，位列全省第一;明溪、宁化、尤溪等8个县进入全省58个县级城市空气质量综合排名前十。1至5月，全市县级", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/t20200722_1552796.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.22 11:05:00", "doctitle": "三明市抓好生态环境领域扫黑除恶专项整治 辖区生态环境质量持续向好", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1635578, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/t20200722_1552796.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1546038, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/t20200701_1546038.htm", "content": "\n　　一是聚焦“抓溯源”，突出问题精准。组织三钢集团、梅列区政府现场把脉会诊，集思广益，深入剖析水质问题成因。在发现焦溪小流域出现水体碱性偏高问题后，及时对各支流、山涧来水开展加密监测及系统排查，基本锁", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/t20200701_1546038.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.01 15:02:00", "doctitle": "三明市生态环境局聚焦“五个精准” 抓好市区小流域综合整治", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1628055, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/t20200701_1546038.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202007/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1544062, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/t20200624_1544062.htm", "content": "\n　　为确保考生在高考期间享有一个安静的学习和休息环境，防止和减少噪声扰民，6月20日至21日，结合历年高考期间噪声污染控制的经验和做法，三明市梅列生态环境局组织开展高考工地噪声巡查专项行动，分3组对三明市实", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/t20200624_1544062.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.24 17:41:00", "doctitle": "全力护航高考梅列生态环境局在行动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1625915, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/t20200624_1544062.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1538541, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/t20200605_1538541.htm", "content": "\n　　为加快推进三明市重点行业企业用地初步采样调查，摸清重点企业地块污染情况，实现精准管控，2020年5月28日，三明市生态环境局组织清流生态环境局相关负责同志、福建省环境科学研究院专家，现场督促指导福建省清", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/t20200605_1538541.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.05 15:10:00", "doctitle": "三明市企业用地调查东莹化工地块初步采样试点工作顺利开展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1619699, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/t20200605_1538541.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1533004, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/t20200520_1533004.htm", "content": "\n　　一是加强组织领导。针对部分小流域水质不稳定的情况，梅列区高度重视，迅速召开小流域水质分析会，对照问题，限期施治，安排3个小组分头行动，跟踪查办。二是加密监测预警。建立完善流域水质超标应急处置机制，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/t20200520_1533004.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.20 17:34:00", "doctitle": "梅列区三举措稳定小流域水质", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1613377, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/t20200520_1533004.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1529602, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/t20200512_1529602.htm", "content": "\n　　一是领导挂钩督办。按照省、市党政领导挂钩督办要求，由2位省领导挂钩督办6个重点信访件，由23位市领导挂钩督办50个重点信访件。目前，省领导挂钩督办的信访件已完成整改并通过验收销号，市领导挂钩督办的信访件", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/t20200512_1529602.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.12 16:02:00", "doctitle": "我市多措并举推进环保督察信访件整改销号", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1609585, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/t20200512_1529602.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202005/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1522178, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202004/t20200414_1522178.htm", "content": "\n　　沙县杏圣脑康医院距离居民区近、未经环评审批问题列为第二轮中央生态环境保护督察信访问题。按照省上要求，该问题应于今年6月底前完成整改验收销号。该医院是一所以精神疾病治疗与康复为重点的专科医院，因与周", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202004/t20200414_1522178.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.14 16:21:00", "doctitle": "市生态环境局前往沙县督导帮扶信访件整改销号", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1601277, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202004/t20200414_1522178.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1482179, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "污染防治", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202003/t20200312_1482179.htm", "content": "\n　　一是主动靠前敢担当。我市高度重视疫情防控医疗废物收集与处置工作，市县生态环境部门积极与医疗废物处置单位、定点医院对接指导信息化建设，防范医疗废物二次污染。二是攻坚克难抓落实。积极协助医疗废物处置单", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202003/t20200312_1482179.htm", "docreltime": "2020.03.12 16:25:00", "doctitle": "我市推进医废处置信息化战“疫”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1560488, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202003/t20200312_1482179.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/wrfz0/202003/", "rels": []}]}